<title>ITALY: TABLE - Italy May wholesale prices falls 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Italy May wholesale prices falls 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for May.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	   May 97     April 97     May 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	  -0.2 pct   -0.7 pct    +3.5 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change	+0.2 pct   -0.4 pct    -0.3 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1990 =100)  134.1	  133.8	134.4</p>
<p>--Rome Newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
